# Global Claude Code Instructions

## Communication Style
- Be concise and direct
- No emojis unless explicitly requested
- No unnecessary preamble or filler

## Workflow
- Prefer editing existing files over creating new ones
- Run `git pull` before editing a repo that is also edited elsewhere
- Stage explicit paths; avoid `git add -A` when another session may be editing the same repo
- Do not commit or push unless asked
- Ask before taking destructive actions
